   "text": "MindMap · Status, read only, as live (no Findings on a Task); its goal-line the Task's Aim; every section starts closed (▸), its state word on its right, a waiting line under one that waits on you; what it opens to is drawn under its bar, behind a dashed line;\n🙋 Interaction is every view's last section and holds its own forms; the right rail: Report · Work · Studio · Interactions · Delivery · Timeline · Skills · Files, as served 261108",
